{
  "uid": "conduit-bottleneck",
  "title": "Conduit 性能瓶颈观测",
  "tags": [
    "conduit"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "1. 各跳速率对比：哪一跳先掉下来",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "链路各跳速率（条/秒）",
      "description": "同一张图比较各跳，曲线从哪一跳开始低于上一跳即为瓶颈。EMQX 的两个计数含设备上行之外的消息（如回执），只作量级参照；emqx_messages_* 与 redis_stream_group_entries_read 的指标名在目标版本上未经实际验证，无数据时先到 Prometheus 里检查名称。流水线入库来自 conduit-server 的 /internal/metrics；Redis 侧的 XADD 与消费组已读保留作交叉验证，两者应大致吻合。 「EMQX 会话已发送」来自 transport 会话监控（累计值取 rate），反映 EMQX 实际往本会话发出的速率。 这些 transport 会话指标只在主实例上有值，备实例（以及采样失败时）恒为 NaN（图中为空），这是设计如此（避免显示陈旧值），不是故障。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(emqx_messages_received[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "EMQX 接收"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(emqx_messages_delivered[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "EMQX 投递"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(redis_commands_total{cmd=\"xadd\"}[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "Redis 流写入（XADD/秒）"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(conduit_pipeline_processed_total{type=\"property\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "流水线入库（server 指标）"
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(redis_stream_group_entries_read[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "消费组已读（Redis 侧，交叉验证）"
        },
        {
          "refId": "F",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "rate(conduit_transport_session_sent[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "EMQX 会话已发送（transport 监控）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "2. 积压",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "EMQX 会话队列",
      "description": "transport 会话监控经 EMQX REST API 采样并导出的队列深度（EMQX 自带 Prometheus 端点不提供）。队列水位=len/max，逼近 100% 将发生溢出丢弃；仅主实例有数据，备实例或采样失败时为空（NaN）。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "队列水位 %"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "percent"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.axisPlacement",
                "value": "right"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "conduit_transport_session_mqueue_len",
          "legendFormat": "队列深度"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "conduit_transport_session_mqueue_len / conduit_transport_session_mqueue_max * 100",
          "legendFormat": "队列水位 %"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
