    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "服务 CPU（核）",
      "description": "各服务自身上报的 CPU 占用（核）。JVM 服务用 Micrometer 的 process_cpu_usage，Redis 用 redis_cpu_*。\n\n**未覆盖 EMQX、PostgreSQL、InfluxDB。** EMQX 的 emqx_vm_cpu_use / emqx_vm_used_memory 是**宿主机**的 CPU 与内存，不是 EMQX 进程自身（实测 emqx_vm_total_memory 与 node_memory_MemTotal_bytes 完全相等，而 EMQX 容器实际仅占约 630 MiB），用它们会把宿主机数据误标成服务数据，故不采用。宿主机整体视图见「6. 宿主机」一组。\n要获得逐容器的 CPU/内存，需启用 metrics-cadvisor profile（镜像在 gcr.io，部分网络不可达）。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 53
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "process_cpu_usage{job=~\"conduit-server|conduit-transport\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} {{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(redis_cpu_sys_seconds_total[1m]) + rate(redis_cpu_user_seconds_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "redis",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "服务内存（JVM 堆+非堆 / Redis）",
      "description": "JVM 服务用 jvm_memory_used_bytes（堆 + 非堆之和，不含堆外与 JVM 自身开销，因此小于容器 RSS）；Redis 用 redis_memory_used_bytes。\n容器内存上限见 .env 的 SERVER_MEM_LIMIT / TRANSPORT_MEM_LIMIT 等，JVM 堆上限按该值的 75% 自动计算（MaxRAMPercentage=75）。\n\n**未覆盖 EMQX、PostgreSQL、InfluxDB。** EMQX 的 emqx_vm_cpu_use / emqx_vm_used_memory 是**宿主机**的 CPU 与内存，不是 EMQX 进程自身（实测 emqx_vm_total_memory 与 node_memory_MemTotal_bytes 完全相等，而 EMQX 容器实际仅占约 630 MiB），用它们会把宿主机数据误标成服务数据，故不采用。宿主机整体视图见「6. 宿主机」一组。\n要获得逐容器的 CPU/内存，需启用 metrics-cadvisor profile（镜像在 gcr.io，部分网络不可达）。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 53
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(jvm_memory_used_bytes{job=~\"conduit-server|conduit-transport\"}) by (job, instance)",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} {{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "expr": "redis_memory_used_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "redis",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
